    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693ecffca1dd68b6cabc293f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女の内に宿す意志の強さは、\nまさにメジロ家を体現する輝き……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "505ae821c40af5a1bb1a4d6bf9943d555d7a6de00910dfe3a11c74d635168c7a",
